{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d2be422b360bfb055ca612fc2f01fc1c17580fbb7564bb425882fa98f28f771c","ja":"ラジオをお聞きのみなさん、\nこんにちは～。","zh":"收音机前的各位听众，\n大家好～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f7ac0fb7f664ed2af0fec1857e10762027cf6c8aae3c9661a45ae26fa52f1a1c","ja":"今日は、私たちのドラマの魅力を\nた～っぷり、お伝えしちゃいますねっ♪","zh":"今天，我要把我们电视剧的魅力，\n满～满地传达给大家哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9fa5821b17cc0e3df2d3773e4fa29b2365900191d871b657a779908a32f508e0","ja":"なんと、魔法学園モノなんだよ！\n真美は、気になる過去を抱えた先生役で～……。","zh":"居然是魔法学园题材哦！\n真美演的是个怀揣着令人在意的过去的老师～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"b9dfd2cf5e11946dae467253396967fec57b07feaefde2d2ec58c4561555322a","ja":"今日は5人でのラジオ番組の収録。\n収録は順調に進み、一旦休憩へ……","zh":"今天是一共5人参与的广播节目收录。\n收录进行得很顺利，暂时进入了休息时间……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"af89c93dd8776a62f53ed7c2762a0336fd47170ed5ae2e0b295b3fb5ddd38377","ja":"あ、ディレクターさん、お疲れ様で～す！\n……え？　このあとオリジナルの呪文を披露、ですか？","zh":"啊，导演先生，辛苦啦～！\n……诶？在这之后要展示原创咒语，是吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"076bb5ff17f1c0cccf0afeaab2f922d1fb8c617b30ea82adf0ba017955090f20","ja":"もちろんいいですよ～。私は『聖母の呪文』を\n言えばいいんですね。お任せください～。","zh":"当然没问题～我只要念\n“圣母的咒语”就可以了吧。包在我身上～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"6442f1e73ff43aeb338972fc3d9f09d08f4c8a54d906ca80aa358f80040df75c","ja":"私は『歌のような呪文』ですね。\nわかりました～♪　どんな呪文がいいかな～♪","zh":"我负责“宛如歌声的咒语”对吧。\n我知道了～♪ 要什么样的咒语好呢～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"caed742ea4bf6a7cb052dfb5b48209837cd4bead19a1a6ec8b0797e44a118890","ja":"ふたりにぴったりの呪文だね。あっ、事前にファンの\n人から、リクエストをもらってたんですね。","zh":"很适合两个人的咒语呢。啊，原来是事先收到了\n粉丝的请求啊。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ec99b7536fcac81ad2c87719f7d17eb5b0eb94afdde5e68016ff11162840f46b","ja":"それでわたしのは……『恋の呪文』？　えへへっ、\nわたしには、こういう呪文をかけてもらいたいんだ♪","zh":"那我的则是……“恋爱的咒语”？嘿嘿，\n人家想被施下这种咒语呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"5a032f31a4b0f92ac57561924bec91091ec1301bdfff643df3c5ebe363dd4083","ja":"あ、でも、どんなこと言えば良いのかな……。\nせっかくなら、ファンの人に喜んでもらいたいし……。","zh":"啊，不过，说什么才好呢……。\n难得有这样的机会，还是想让粉丝们开心嘛……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"6921e44d7885ccc6f223d38bbddba3d5e735b26c01960ce4e400770a72493bdb","ja":"そうですね～……。では、私の呪文は、\n「子豚ちゃんたちに光あれ」で、どうでしょう～？","zh":"我想想哦～……。那么，我的咒语用\n“愿小猪仔们沐浴在光芒之中”，您觉得怎么样呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"c5fe559f34f2c3dd0ebc1e0656e474785f026c7b706c00427e684e1814cf27eb","ja":"わぁっ、ステキです！　じゃあ私は～……。","zh":"哇，太棒了！那我～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"e4902fe11a076c79e2fa58154f3c3785b3dbfa0e11aa9cd35f48b3c3fdf8ee4f","ja":"「みんな～♪　くるっと回って～♪\n笑顔になって～♪　一緒に歌お～♪」とか？","zh":"“大家～♪　转个圈圈～♪\n绽开笑脸～♪　一起唱吧～♪”这样？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"cc532e00327c7083c0b652005e349a3fdee3234aeebf694025e2f7d5afb5fa5c","ja":"えっ！？　ふたりとも、もうできたの！？","zh":"咦！？你们两个，已经做好了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1098.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"2300122f401401f667dc51b9a926bd831b1637673d30b10e8a3c7b79f1520c78","ja":"どうしよう……。わたしも早く決めなきゃ……！","zh":"怎么办……我也得快点决定才行……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
